		                    	    <BR>
									<font color=white>
									<BR>EoD have resisted the public advertisement of what we do monthly, what drops we get, what we have killed and who is in the guild for some time.  However,  we have taken this first step into bringing some of our game life to a wider audience.<BR><BR>We will be updating the news on a monthly basis letting you what we have killed and what has dropped.  We will include some pics of encounters - perhaps victories - or perhaps tragic. <BR><BR>We have also added a 'Kill Table' - this is a list of the mobs throughout all of the expansions we have killed, the number of times we killed them and of course what was our best break on the mob (number of people min to kill).<BR><BR>The Rules and Apply functions are still present although they have been jazzed up for this UI.  <BR><BR>We hope you like the new guest site.<BR><BR>Majouth<BR><BR>
